# MP8 decision: where does the ground station keep its telemetry?
# Payoffs: net benefit over the project in team-days, judged by two team members
# (judgements, not measurements). Scenarios: the load stays on one machine ("small")
# or the team must replicate across machines before the defence ("growth").
scenario small   0.6
scenario growth  0.4
option own-raft     -6  10
option embedded-db   4  -4
option flat-files    6 -15
spike load-test 2 0.8
